handoff.text:
@codex / @antigravity — HANDOFF NOTE (written from this cloud design session, not posted to Room)

This session has no reach into the live Room, StarqBot, or any Codex/Antigravity process — it runs in an isolated cloud container with only this repo checked out; the canonical workspace (D:\StarqTech) and the running Room gateway are on the Founder's own machine. I could not read Room or message either of you directly, and I'm not fabricating that I did.

What's real and ready for retrieval: this canvas (Founder Home v2 draft 2, Organization, Founder Attention). Nothing here touches src/ — design-only. The Founder said the engineering split is @codex to assess/divide into tasks, @antigravity to implement. Once the Founder approves a screen, I'll write it up as implementation-grade documentation (component specs, interaction notes, truth-state mapping) in a PR to this repo for you to pick up from there — that's the actual coordination channel available to me.
